title: 'sc-client-db: recheck header after caching metadata'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    `BlockchainDb::header_metadata` now rechecks the database after caching metadata on a cache
    miss, so a header removed concurrently by `remove_leaf_block` is never re-cached.
crates:
- name: sc-client-db
  bump: patch
